stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING : Online Cart Checkout Initiated
    [*] --> DELIVERED : In-Store POS Sale Completed (Cash / Card)

    PENDING --> CONFIRMED : Payment Verified (Card / Fawry)
    PENDING --> CANCELLED : Payment Timeout / Customer Cancel

    CONFIRMED --> PREPARING : Store Staff Begin Order Assembly
    CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : Out of Stock / Merchant Reject

    PREPARING --> READY : Items Packed & Staged at Dispatch
    PREPARING --> CANCELLED : Partial Failure (Inventory Restored)

    READY --> OUT_FOR_DELIVERY : Courier Dispatched
    READY --> DELIVERED : Customer In-Store Pickup Completed

    OUT_FOR_DELIVERY --> DELIVERED : Customer Signed & Received
    OUT_FOR_DELIVERY --> CANCELLED : Failed Delivery Attempt

    DELIVERED --> REFUNDED : Authorized Manager Refund (Stock Restocked)

    CANCELLED --> [*]
    REFUNDED --> [*]
